      469.68,
      562.39,
      587.75
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land, on which aservitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before meat Ambanganga Korale Divisional Secretariat, on the 09thday of August, 2016 at 10.00 a. m. and are hereby requested tonotify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 02nd dayof August 2016 the nature of their interests in the land, theparticulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisitionof the said land, the amount of compensation and the detailsof the computation of such amount.",
